ened Brightwell lotion, and let your watch track the next 5 nights.\"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"toolu_01Vss91fSFyASTy54ZaEACnn","content":"{\"shown\":true}"}],"latencies":[3645,7387,6847,9647,7212],"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-5.5"}